# Every version of the loose pair GeneralsX has ever shipped: sha256, two spaces, the path
# relative to a game folder. run.sh removes a file from a game folder ONLY when its sha256 AND
# path match a line here. Add a line whenever either file changes; bundle-macos-zh.sh refuses to
# package a pair whose hash is missing. Never remove a line: an old install may still hold it.
# Data/INI/Weapon.ini is deliberately NOT here (25/09/2026): no build ever installed it into a game
# folder, so a copy found in one is somebody else's and is never removed. Its bytes are pinned by
# make-weapon-ini.py and re-derived by verify-bundle-overlay.sh instead.
